The MIT license below covers only what Marlo (UnsilentMarLo, also "Degulum" / "MarLo" in the mod files) wrote or created
himself: the Lua code in `lua/` and `hook/` that is not derived from game files, the numeric changes and new fields in the
blueprints, and any model or texture that is entirely his own work.

It does NOT cover the many files that descend from Supreme Commander: Forged Alliance's game data (unit scripts and
blueprints with "Copyright 2005 Gas Powered Games, Inc." headers, animations, base-game projectile models and the textures
derived from them), from FAF's Lua, or from other authors (Mikko Tyster / Blade Braver code). Those keep their original
terms, which do not allow redistribution under MIT. Which assets are original has not been established (THIRD_PARTY.md lists
what is known); until then nobody should assume that the zip as a whole is MIT.

